{"reviewId": "254854030_85CYEfEEK", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "康波周期决定了资产价格的大趋势，人跟着趋势走才能赚大钱，个人财富规划绕不开这个大规律。婴儿潮一代生在康波繁荣期，成年后买房、买股票，赶上几十年资产上涨的大行情，躺着都能赚，要是生在康波萧条期，不管你多会理财，房价、股价长期横盘甚至下跌，再折腾也很难赚到大钱。所以不是人决定财富，是你赶上的康波大趋势决定财富。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "从某种意义上看，人生的财富由康波决定，因为康波的本质表现是价格的波动，而人生的财富积累根本上源于资产价格的投资或投机，人生财富靠康波，康波就是人生的财富规划。", "range": "1216-1295", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "254854030_85CYEfEEK", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1766542890, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 87, "likes": [{"userVid": 201418595, "name": "蒋七七viola", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEKHvUnH66VJSgw7dmkULyGqrhaH21WeSXGg4UQSibIDCtnjIGBY2CLABZ5Cf9JAmTIIVHGriaDatlEEofUoc1kGDNJ4ibPCLE9cvkCRIF5yFYGSA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-E-0-0-0", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 4, "hotComments": [], "comme